@startuml
title Diagram 7 — Peran & Hak Akses per Modul (fokus sales)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
left to right direction

actor "Sales Rep" as SR
actor "Sales Manager" as SM
actor "Tenant Admin" as TA
actor "Manajemen /\nHead of Sales" as MG

rectangle "CRM Multi-Tenant — per Tenant" {
  usecase "Kelola lead" as UC1
  usecase "Kelola kontak & akun" as UC2
  usecase "Kelola peluang\n& stage" as UC3
  usecase "Tetapkan kuota bulanan" as UC4
  usecase "Lihat status performa\n& laporan performa" as UC5
  usecase "Lihat laporan revenue\n& pipeline" as UC6
  usecase "Kelola tenant, user,\nrole & permission" as UC11
  usecase "Konfigurasi webhook\n& pantau delivery log" as UC12
}

SR --> UC1
SR --> UC2
SR --> UC3

SM --> UC3
SM --> UC4
SM --> UC5
SM --> UC6

MG --> UC6
MG --> UC5

TA --> UC11
TA --> UC12

note bottom of UC11
  Isolasi data antar tenant bersifat WAJIB —
  pelanggaran isolasi = kegagalan paling berat
  pada produk multi-tenant.
end note
@enduml
